data: {"id": "351c5c6a81fd454b-thinking-layer-149", "run_id": "351c5c6a81fd454b", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "集群中仅发现一个异常 Pod：`workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh`（Namespace: `aiops-case-05`）。\n\n该 Pod 当前状态为 `ContainerCreating`，通常意味着容器正在初始化或等待挂载卷/拉取镜像。根据 `pod-abnormal-type` 的归因逻辑，`ContainerCreating` 阶段常与卷挂载失败（VolumeMountFailed）或镜像拉取问题（ImagePullFailed）相关。由于无法仅凭状态确认是哪种问题，我将获取相关的诊断手册以备后续证据采集节点使用。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789058271123}

