CreatePodSandBox) → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 [1,2,3]\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 的网络配置引用了一个在该 Namespace (`aiops-case-05`) 中不存在的 Multus 网络定义资源 `unavailable-network`（证据 [1]、[2]）。这导致 Multus 插件在尝试配置网络时抛出 `NoNetworkFound` 错误，进而致使 Kubelet 创建 Sandbox 失败，Pod 无法启动（证据 [3]）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 53.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 53.1s (Evidence 44.7s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.256, "metrics": {"run_id": "351c5c6a81fd454b", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.26122808456421, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 